  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in Tokyo at his syndicate office, Furuya has a doctor tend to his stiffening leg before heading into the back room—unaware that Toshi has come alone to settle Muranishi's debt in blood.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "それポン。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "おう、サヤカちょっと待て。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "これたまに動かさないと、マヒして退化しちまうんだと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "あの時撃たれたのが高くついたもんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ちょっと奥の部屋にいいか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "その類いの目が俺の栄養になるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "大歓迎だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "殺すなよ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "何やっとんじゃ！親父！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい、なあ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "なあ、親父！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "ダメだ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "それポン。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll claim that tile—pon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "おう、サヤカちょっと待て。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on a second.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "これたまに動かさないと、マヒして退化しちまうんだと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The doctor says if I don't move this leg once in a while, it'll go numb and wither away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "あの時撃たれたのが高くついたもんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Getting shot back then sure ended up costing me dearly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ちょっと奥の部屋にいいか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mind stepping into the back room with me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "その類いの目が俺の栄養になるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That defiant look in your eyes is pure nourishment to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "大歓迎だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I welcome it wholeheartedly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "殺すなよ、トシ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't kill anyone, Toshi...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "何やっとんじゃ！親父！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What the hell are you doing?! Boss!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "おい、なあ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey—come on!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "なあ、親父！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stay with us, Boss!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "ダメだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's no use—he's gone.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
